   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Multi-Partner Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results are reported here: https://mptf.undp.org/fund/cov00</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN interagency funding mechanism to support low- and middle income countries to respond to the COVID-19 crisis and recover from the socio-economic shocks.


In the first call for proposals, the COVID-19 MPTF is open to 46 Least Developed Countries (LDCs), Lower Middle-Income Countries and selected Small Island Developing States (SIDS). These countries are not covered by the COVID-19 Global Humanitarian Response Plan. There will be additional calls to follow.</narrative>
  </description>
